<title>JAPAN: BOJ says sees July-Sept M2+CD growth around 3 pct.</title>
<headline>BOJ says sees July-Sept M2+CD growth around 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Thursday it expects Japan's broadly defined money supply average of M2 plus certificates of deposit (CDs) for the July-September quarter to grow at around three percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>M2+CDs grew a preliminary 3.0 percent year on year in the April-June period.</p>
</text>
